# 仓库内的换行归一化：检出即 LF，避免 Windows/CI 之间的 CRLF 噪音。
# 例外：PowerShell 脚本使用 CRLF（见 .editorconfig）。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary

# 中文文档统一按文本处理，避免被误判为二进制
*.md text diff merge
*.sql text
*.java text
*.xml text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.json text
*.vue text
*.ts text
*.js text
